## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> 1. **Default Login Roles:** Do you want pre-populated accounts for testing each dashboard (Customer, Pharmacy, Admin)? We plan to seed:
>    - `customer@medifind.com` / `password123`
>    - `pharmacy@medifind.com` / `password123` (ABC Pharmacy)
