> 2. **Emergency Delivery Radius:** Should the app restrict emergency delivery to a certain radius (e.g., 5km or 10km) or show all nearby pharmacies ordered by distance? We plan to calculate distances using the Haversine formula on latitude/longitude and highlight closest ones.

